When implementing screens from Google Stitch:

- Treat Stitch as visual source of truth.
- Do not copy generated HTML.
- Rebuild using reusable React components.
- Follow project architecture.
- Reuse existing components first.
- Separate presentation from business logic.
- Preserve UX while improving maintainability.

Always explain architectural decisions in generated code comments when non-obvious.
